# Typography vocabulary

Follow `AGENTS.md`. Two rules, always:

## 1. Never remove Storybook typography legacy aliases

Do not delete, empty, or hide the **Legacy aliases** section on Foundations → Typography.

Marker in code: `DO_NOT_REMOVE_LEGACY_TYPE_ALIASES`

Must keep:

- `legacyAliasType` in `apps/storybook/stories/foundations/typography-data.ts`
- The "Legacy aliases" `TokenSection` in `apps/storybook/stories/foundations/typography.stories.tsx`

## 2. New vocabulary in components

New or edited UI must use `type-*` roles, not raw size + weight stacks.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
<h2 className="text-lg font-semibold" />
<p className="text-sm" />
<span className="text-xs font-medium" />

// ✅ GOOD
<h2 className="type-title" />
<p className="type-body" />
<span className="type-caption-strong" />
```

Pair with color: `className="type-body text-fg-secondary"`.

| Use | Not |
|---|---|
| `type-heading` | `text-2xl font-semibold` |
| `type-body` | `text-sm` |
| `type-body-strong` | `text-sm font-medium` |
| `type-caption` | `text-xs` |
| `type-code` | `font-mono text-sm` |
